{#-
  A sample newsletter from a person, for the Storybook preview only.
  Invented content. It shows the three values a campaign sets when it is
  not from the team: see newsletter.html.j2.
-#}
{% extends "newsletter.html.j2" %}
{% set signoff_name = "Mark Bailey" %}
{% set signoff_role = "Bailey Medics" %}
{% set from_name = "Mark at " ~ t.sender_name %}
{% import "_components.html.j2" as c with context %}
{% block subject %}A note from Mark{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}Something I wanted to say myself.{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
{{ c.heading("A *personal* note") }}
{{ c.paragraph("Hello,") }}
{{ c.paragraph("Most of our newsletters come from the team. Now and then there is something I would rather say myself, and this is what one of those looks like.") }}
{{ c.paragraph("Thank you for reading.") }}
{% endblock %}

{% block text %}
Hello,

Most of our newsletters come from the team. Now and then there is something I would rather say myself, and this is what one of those looks like.

Thank you for reading.

{{ signoff_text }}
{% endblock %}
